{"q":"위험도 '높음' 자산이 끊는 구간은 어느 이웃 선로로 넘길 수 있나?","en":"Which neighbouring feeders can take the zones cut off by high-risk assets?","cypher":"MATCH (a:Asset)-[:INSTALLED_AT]->(loc)-[:FEEDS*]->(z:FeederZone)-[:TIE_TO]->(t)\nWHERE a.riskScore >= 15\nRETURN DISTINCT a.code AS asset, z.label AS zone, t.name AS tie\nORDER BY zone","rows":[["AS-TR-0007","D/L #1 Z2 (S1 뒤)","연계 개폐기 T1 (D/L #2)"],["AS-TR-0007","D/L #1 Z4 (S3 뒤)","연계 개폐기 T2 (D/L #3)"],["AS-TR-0007","D/L #1 Z6 (S5 뒤)","연계 개폐기 T3 (D/L #2)"],["AS-TR-0007","D/L #1 Z7 (S6 뒤)","연계 개폐기 T4 (C변전소)"]]},{"q":"자산이 등록되지 않은 기능 위치(빈 자리)는 고장 나면 몇 호에 영향을 주나?","en":"Functional locations with no asset installed: how many customers do they affect?","cypher":"// 자산관리 쪽 기능 위치만 (ex:_mRID 는 배전선로 모델 설비)\nMATCH (loc)-[:FEEDS]->()\nWHERE loc.uri STARTS WITH 'http://example.org/grid#'\n  AND NOT loc.uri STARTS WITH 'http://example.org/grid#_'\n  AND NOT EXISTS { (:Asset)-[:INSTALLED_AT]->(loc) }\nMATCH (loc)-[:FEEDS*]->(ld)\nWHERE ld.customers IS NOT NULL\nWITH DISTINCT loc, ld\nRETURN 'ex:' + split(loc.uri, '#')[1] AS loc, sum(ld.customers) AS customers","rows":[["ex:BUS_154","1914"],["ex:BUS_22","1914"]]}]}